WEBVTT

00:20:59.204 --> 00:21:02.413
in interviews, that interviewers
spend a lot of time.

00:21:02.413 --> 00:21:06.246
They make their mind up very quickly
and they spend the rest of

00:21:06.246 --> 00:21:09.954
the interview confirming what they believe
, which is really a waste of time.

00:21:10.454 --> 00:21:15.996
Yes. Yes. So the idea of delaying your
intuition is to make sure that you've

00:21:15.996 --> 00:21:18.954
gathered comprehensive, accurate,

00:21:19.454 --> 00:21:23.163
unbiased information so that then
when your intuition forms,

00:21:23.163 --> 00:21:26.871
it's based on better sources, better data.
That is that what you're after?

00:21:26.913 --> 00:21:33.871
Yes, because I don't think you can make
decisions without there being endorsed